;padding: 0 12.8px;background-color: #f4f4f4;margin: 1em 0;"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;前方高能，非战斗人员离开</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;好羞耻啊，两米长的呆毛果然不一般</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/naxurt/341a675cfc82c0d1.jpg" alt="341a675cfc82c0d1.jpg" class="image" /><br /> 感谢<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anshang-feng" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3972286&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607109060" alt="Anshang Feng" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3972286)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anshang-feng" >Anshang Feng</a></span>绘制</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div style="border: 1px dashed #999;padding: 0 12.8px;background-color: #f4f4f4;margin: 1em 0;"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;这里是不一样的风味;-)</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;希望喜欢</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/naxurt/550ae580154ac05.jpg" alt="550ae580154ac05.jpg" class="image" /><br /> 感谢<span style="color: rgb(38, 92, 179)">腐樱拾大大</span>绘制</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-5" style="display:none"> <p>这里是留言板，请尽情留言吧。<br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-naxurt" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4423816&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607109060" alt="Dr_Naxurt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4423816)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-naxurt" >Dr_Naxurt</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 咕咕咕 蠕虫喜提人事，庆祝！♡(*´･ω･)(･ω･`*)♡<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/achsab" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4325914&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607109060" alt="achsab" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4325914)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/achsab" >achsab</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 嘿美丽女孩！偷偷留个言，跑走！<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-hermes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4748791&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607109060" alt="Chris Hermes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4748791)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-hermes" >Chris Hermes</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 恭喜人事+1（<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">突然复读</span>） 忙着学习的话就不用记着更文啦！多沉淀沉淀也是好的（我b话好多来着）<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/imreallystav" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3766165&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607109060" alt="imreallystav" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3766165)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/imreallystav" >imreallystav</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 事大佬！awsl<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/r-allen" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5663983&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607109060" alt="R Allen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5663983)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/r-allen" >R Allen</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 虽然几个月前就知道了，但是现在来的屑(，不愧是你，轻易做到了我们做不到的事情<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kyubi-duck" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5437364&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607109060" alt="Kyubi_Duck" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5437364)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kyubi-duck" >Kyubi_Duck</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 作者页-8而且还把up和down扣了的鸽子前来观光。<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrpasserby" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5150580&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607109060" alt="MrPasserby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5150580)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrpasserby" >MrPasserby</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 跳段街舞 ጿ ኈ ቼ ዽ ጿ ኈ<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rorrerd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3453246&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607109060" alt="rorrErD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3453246)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rorrerd" >rorrErD</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 啊，再来看看蠕蠕人事叭~16篇原创真的好厉害的（虽然我还没多读过）蠕蠕文学上很出众还常常在草稿区出没……orz是榜样没错了。<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/just-we" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4020589&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607109060" alt="Just_We" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4020589)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/just-we" >Just_We</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 单推超强可爱蠕蠕蠕蠕蠕蠕蠕蠕蠕蠕蠕蠕蠕蠕vtuber出道！！！绝赞蠕虫酱你值得拥有www<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6062512&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607109060" alt="YUANNN" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6062512)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn" >YUANNN</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 呜呜呜呜呜我好了！<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raidwine" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6455279&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607109060" alt="Raidwine" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6455279)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raidwine" >Raidwine</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 草 不许说你朋友好了<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raidwine" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6455279&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607109060" alt="Raidwine" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6455279)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raidwine" >Raidwine</a></span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">不过我也好了</span>。<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5474061&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607109060" alt="Auroriaaaaa" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5474061)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa" >Auroriaaaaa</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 蠕虫太强了，我想